        "created_at": "2016-07-17T16:51:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm posting here in hopes for a response. &nbsp;I reached out about a week ago through the contact page, but have not heard back. &nbsp;</p><p>I kickstarted the Geiger Expansion, received it a while ago, but didn't try to do anything with it until just recently. &nbsp;When I did open it I found that I am missing the plastic \"rivet\" to hold thespinner together. &nbsp;How do I do about getting one of these?</p>",
